6SV2.1 provenance
------------------

This C port is derived from and numerically validated against the 6SV2.1
reference source published at:

    https://github.com/NakamuraTakashi/6SV2.1

The validation reference is pinned at commit:

    7deb2289cfe23c9b1d1b48d7647f76604ef75fa4

6SV was developed by Eric F. Vermote and collaborators. Routine-level source
comments and the project documentation retain attribution to the corresponding
6SV2.1 Fortran routines. This provenance statement does not replace the
GPL-2.0-or-later terms governing libsixsv.
